': {'id': 'Tm90ZVR3ZWV0OjE4ODMzNTk4MTY1Nzc2NjI5NzY=', 'text': 'My dog was diagnosed with cancer in her ear canal and radiation was recommended. Even with radiation the vet gave her about 6 months to live. I said no to his recommended treatment pattern. I put her on an all protein diet and started Ivermectin in intervals of 2weeks. In 4 months her cancer was completely gone. The last pic was taken in the 3rd month. She lived another 2 years and she didn’t die of cancer. If I had gone the other route she probably wouldn’t have lived more than another 6 months. I know dogs and humans are different but it definitely saved my baby.', 'entity_set': {'hashtags': [], 'symbols': [], 'urls': [], 'user_mentions': []}}}}, 'legacy': {'bookmark_count': 14, 'bookmarked': False, 'created_at': 'Sun Jan 26 03:42:26 +0000 2025', 'conversation_id_str': '1883131119908077971', 'display_text_range': [14, 288], 'entities': {'hashtags': [], 'media': [{'display_url': 'pic.x.com/HBNOuILNju', 'expanded_url': 'https://x.com/DeborahGravley/status/1883359816678269232/photo/1', 'id_str': '1883359809648431104', 'indices': [289, 312], 'media_key': '3_1883359809648431104', 'media_url_https': 'https://pbs.twimg.com/media/GiMJxLZXkAA4xxK.jpg', 'type': 'photo', 'url': 'https://t.co/HBNOuILNju', 'ext_media_availability': {'status': 'Available'}, 'features': {'large': {'faces': []}, 'medium': {'faces': []}, 'small': {'faces': []}, 'orig': {'faces': []}}, 'sizes': {'large': {'h': 1466, 'w': 2048, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'medium': {'h': 859, 'w': 1200, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'small': {'h': 487, 'w': 680, 'resize': 'fit'}, 'thumb': {'h': 150, 'w': 150, 'resize': 'crop'}}, 'original_info': {'height': 1466, 'width': 2048, 'focus_rects': [{'x': 0, 'y': 195, 'w': 2048, 'h': 1147}, {'x': 0, 'y': 0, 'w': 1466, 'h': 1466}, {'x': 22, 'y': 0, 'w': 1286, 'h': 1466}, {'x': 299, 'y': 0, 'w': 733, 'h': 1466}, {'x': 0, 'y': 0, 'w': 2048, 'h': 1466}]}, 'media_results': {'result': {'media_key': '3_1883359809648431104'}}}, {'display_ur